{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image data using transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, aiming to improve performance beyond RNA-only baselines. The validation accuracy of 0.713 and F1 of 0.6945 exceed the best RNA-only multiprofile baseline (0.653 accuracy), suggesting multimodal integration may enhance performance. However, the exact contribution of weighted fusion versus other design choices remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence, and the broader effectiveness of image data in multimodal settings requires further analysis."
}

